        "Intercellular CO2 concentration declines, restricting Rubisco carboxylation and net CO2 assimilation."
      ],
      "typical_time_course": "Early and commonly reversible during mild-to-moderate drought."
    },
    {
      "mechanism": "Hormonal and hydraulic regulation",
