        "These effects reduce photophosphorylation and the supply of ATP and NADPH required by the Calvin cycle."
      ],
      "typical_time_course": "More prominent during severe or prolonged drought."
    },
    {
      "mechanism": "Photoinhibition and oxidative stress",
      "details": [
