      "ito_formula": "If X_t follows an Itô SDE and f is sufficiently smooth, then df = f_t dt + f_x dX_t + 0.5f_xx dt. After substituting dX_t, the coefficient of dt includes the second-order correction 0.5σ²f_xx."
    },
    {
      "topic": "5. Analytical solution patterns",
      "patterns": [
        "Additive-noise SDE with constant coefficients",
        "Linear SDE",
        "Geometric Brownian motion",
        "Ornstein–Uhlenbeck process as an extension"
