      "topic": "6. Numerical approximation",
      "method": "Euler–Maruyama",
      "equation": "X_(n+1) = X_n + μ(X_n,t_n)Δt + σ(X_n,t_n)ΔW_n, where ΔW_n = √Δt Z_n and Z_n is standard normal."
