        "Since multiplication by 2 is injective, H₂(RP²;Z)=0.",
        "Since Z/2Z is the cokernel of multiplication by 2, H₁(RP²;Z)=Z/2Z.",
        "Because RP² is path-connected, H₀(RP²;Z)=Z."
