        "The multiplication-by-2 map becomes zero after applying Hom_Z(−,Z).",
        "Thus H⁰(RP²;Z)=Z, H¹(RP²;Z)=0, and H²(RP²;Z)=Z/2Z.",
        "The universal coefficient theorem gives the same result through 0→Ext_Z(Z/2Z,Z)→H²(RP²;Z)→Hom_Z(0,Z)→0."
